{"id": "UgzUNoCgbKQLy-3G32R4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 3, "text": "전혀 다른디 케바케", "published": "2026-10-12T18:12:36", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgzmOq_LRk-En1nVM0N4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "일봉 기준일지 월봉기준일지 안 나오는군", "published": "2026-10-12T09:48:51", "replies": 1, "creator": false}
